@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:目前来到花田的有<br>艾玛、雪莉、汉娜和梅露露四个人。|#0103Adv12_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（尽管每个人我都邀了……<br>　不过到头来还是只有我们四个人……）|#0103Adv12_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然有些难受……<br>　但是，今天就让我们放下一切，好好享受吧！）|#0103Adv12_Ema002|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:广阔的后院里绿草如茵，花团锦簇，<br>远处是一片蔚蓝的天空。|#0103Adv12_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜和梅露露<br>已经开始在餐布上摆放食物。|#0103Adv12_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里视野真好～！|#0103Adv12_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然总是有彩虹出现很诡异，<br>但在这种时候反而让人觉得开心呢。|#0103Adv12_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; お茶を淹れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_31 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:大家请喝点热茶吧。|#0103Adv12_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，谢谢梅露露！<br>能喝到热茶真开心！|#0103Adv12_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛你不是身体不舒服吗，<br>如果觉得难受一定要说哦！|#0103Adv12_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你，雪莉。<br>我已经没事了。应该是太累了吧。|#0103Adv12_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:1.8 Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:75,60 AppearanceAndTransition:16_1 SubId:Middle
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:MainBackground-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:25 Duration:20
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:大家一起享用着梅露露特制的三明治、<br>点心和热茶。|#0103Adv12_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:微风轻拂树叶，<br>沐浴在盛开的花香中，令人感觉格外惬意。|#0103Adv12_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（只是换个地方，<br>　就能让心情变得这么平静……）|#0103Adv12_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（看来我们的确需要转换心情。<br>　以后也要多策划一些活动）|#0103Adv12_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（比如卡拉OK啊，游戏大会什么的……<br>　大家一起来玩的话，一定很开心）|#0103Adv12_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们一边吃着点心，<br>一边采摘花朵，欢声笑语着。|#0103Adv12_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们难得地<br>度过了悠闲的时光。|#0103Adv12_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:16_1 SubId:Middle

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你笑得真好看。|#0103Adv12_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是、是吗？可能因为好久没这样了，<br>不知不觉就很开心。|#0103Adv12_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和朋友待在一起，聊天说笑……<br>真的，好久没有这样了……|#0103Adv12_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:曾经与朋友欢笑的场景，<br>如雾般在脑海中浮现。|#0103Adv12_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:伴随着莫名的心痛，<br>艾玛迅速甩开了这个画面。|#0103Adv12_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:对、对不起擅自说我们是朋友！<br>虽、虽说可能和朋友有点不一样！|#0103Adv12_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Flushed1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:是朋友没错哦。|#0103Adv12_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜直截了当地说完，<br>害羞地扭过头去。|#0103Adv12_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜……谢谢你……|#0103Adv12_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:就是就是！我们已经是朋友了！<br>我们之后也要一直在一起，所以我们是“挚友”！|#0103Adv12_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呃，这个词好像不是这样解释的啦。|#0103Adv12_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:好了，时间差不多了……|#0103Adv12_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在大家吃得差不多的时候，<br>雪莉站了起来。|#0103Adv12_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，要回去了吗？|#0103Adv12_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:才不是呢。现在才是重头戏！|#0103Adv12_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11,ArmL10 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:锵锵！|#0103Adv12_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉不知从哪里拿出一把扫帚举了起来。<br>|#0103Adv12_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（啊！是刚才拿着的扫帚！<br>　……到底要用来做什么呢？）|#0103Adv12_Ema012|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:要用扫帚做什么？|#0103Adv12_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜似乎和艾玛有着同样的疑问，<br>向雪莉发问。|#0103Adv12_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵呵～你问得好！<br>我想让汉娜用它飞一飞！|#0103Adv12_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:什么……|#0103Adv12_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊！原来如此！|#0103Adv12_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉拿着扫帚向汉娜逼近。|#0103Adv12_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL4 SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:说到魔女不就是骑扫帚飞行吗！？|#0103Adv12_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们不就是<br>打小看着骑扫帚飞行的魔女长大的吗！？|#0103Adv12_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:自从典狱长说到魔女，<br>我就一直想看这个！|#0103Adv12_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你在刚被抓来时的那种危险情况下<br>居然在想这种事！？|#0103Adv12_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR8,ArmL4 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:这把扫帚<br>可是承载着全人类的梦想！|#0103Adv12_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你在故意说得夸张想让我上当吧！？|#0103Adv12_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11,ArmL10 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜快试试看嘛！<br>求你了！|#0103Adv12_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉把扫帚递到汉娜面前。|#0103Adv12_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你不也是预备魔女吗！？<br>怎么你不自己来！？|#0103Adv12_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR11,ArmL10 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:我是名侦探，可飞不起来！|#0103Adv12_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而汉娜却能飞！<br>这是独一无二的特技！|#0103Adv12_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Angry1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:别说是独一无二！|#0103Adv12_Hanna010| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11,ArmL10 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:如果可以的话，让我在后面坐着吧！|#0103Adv12_Sherry016| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉眼睛闪闪发亮，<br>露出了孩童般的表情。|#0103Adv12_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:唔、唔……|#0103Adv12_Hanna011| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜两眼湿湿地<br>向艾玛和梅露露投去求助的眼神。|#0103Adv12_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（对不起汉娜……<br>　这股气势恐怕谁也拦不住……）|#0103Adv12_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:如、如果有什么我能帮上忙的就好了……<br>但是对不起～～|#0103Adv12_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我实在是没办法飞行……<br>我该怎么办才好……啊哇哇哇……|#0103Adv12_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看到梅露露快要哭出来的样子，<br>汉娜无奈地叹了口气。|#0103Adv12_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:……知道了！<br>试试就试试吧！|#0103Adv12_Hanna012| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜一把抢过雪莉手中的扫帚。|#0103Adv12_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR8,ArmL8 SubId:Middle
@EmoteJumpDouble ActorIds:Sherry-Middle Loop:false Speed:1

[PrintTextModified Text:太好了～！|#0103Adv12_Sherry017| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉高兴得跳了起来。<br>艾玛也忍不住笑了。|#0103Adv12_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（汉娜其实挺好说话的呢……）|#0103Adv12_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:然后——|#0103Adv12_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

