@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_18_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……好、好重……|#0103Adv12_Hanna013| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应雪莉的愿望，<br>汉娜正骑着扫帚飞行。|#0103Adv12_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:准确地说并不是骑着扫帚飞行，<br>而是手持扫帚飘浮在空中。|#0103Adv12_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且后面还载着雪莉，<br>所以只能摇摇晃晃地低空飞行。|#0103Adv12_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:40 ScenePositionY:30 Scale:2 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:5

[PrintTextModified Text:哇～！感觉自己变成魔女了～！|#0103Adv12_Sherry018| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不可以变成魔女啊！|#0103Adv12_Hanna014| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好～开～心～！！|#0103Adv12_Sherry019| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我可一点都不开心哇！？|#0103Adv12_Hanna015| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜一脸辛苦地<br>勉强维持着飞行的姿态。|#0103Adv12_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了实现雪莉的愿望，<br>她涨红着脸，拼命不让自己掉下来。|#0103Adv12_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]


@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:80 ScenePositionY:50 Scale:1.6 EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:5

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样飞过围墙吧！|#0103Adv12_Sherry020| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你傻了吗！？|#0103Adv12_Hanna016| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是能飞过围墙的话，<br>我肯定会把你和扫帚都丢下去！|#0103Adv12_Hanna017| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸～<br>不能用扫帚之力想想办法吗～？|#0103Adv12_Sherry021| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Stills-Middle Loop:false ScenePositionX:50 ScenePositionY:50 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} EasingTypeName:Linear Duration:5

[PrintTextModified Text:这只是清洁用的扫帚又不是魔法扫帚！|#0103Adv12_Hanna018| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:真想把你丢下去啊～！|#0103Adv12_Hanna019| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请不要丢下我～|#0103Adv12_Sherry022| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别贴这么近啦～！好热～！|#0103Adv12_Hanna020| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉她——|#0103Adv12_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

