[PrintTextModified Text:哇哦，要好好保持平衡哦！|#0103Adv12_Sherry023| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你还好意思说！？|#0103Adv12_Hanna021| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜一边嬉闹着，<br>一边在蓝天中飞翔。|#0103Adv12_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

